---
source: crates/imify-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "normalize_doctor_text(&text(&output.stdout), &server.uri())"
---
imify-cli <version> (<os> <arch>)

ok    api_url       http://127.0.0.1:<port> (IMIFY_API_URL)
ok    health        Reachable in <n> ms.
ok    readiness     Database ok, storage ok.
ok    clock         The local clock is within 60 s of the server.
fail  token         IMIFY_TOKEN is not set, and no login for http://127.0.0.1:<port> is stored in <config dir>/credentials.json.
                    hint: Run `imify auth login`, or set `IMIFY_TOKEN` to a token.
skip  token_expiry  Skipped because token did not pass.
skip  account       Skipped because token did not pass.
ok    oidc          Issuer https://login.example.com, client client-1.
